{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1287496-chapter-fiction-the-lunar-signature-pack","id":1287496,"title":"Chapter fiction: The Lunar signature pack?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-13T05:38:38-08:00","id":1287496,"title":"Chapter fiction: The Lunar signature pack?","content":"The Dragonblood fiction was mostly about the signature circle; I imagine this is too.<br /> <br /> So we seem to have, if I've read correctly:<br /> Sazay Shadow-Dancer, a Fennec-Fox-totem woman from the South. I'm guessing she is the Changing Moon, as she's interested in intrigue and social relations.<br /> Azu Tegama Asarkon, an aristocrat of noble blood (Azu's an honorific, not his name) from the Scavenger Lands, and the Pack's Full Moon. I don't know what his totem is. He once overthrew a tyrant.<br /> These two are adherants in the Silver Pact, and have different Shahan-Yas (or, I guess, follow a pair of Shahan-Yas? That seems unlikely).<br /> Tula, a new (and thus, I'm going to assumeCasteless) Lunar bandit woman from a Northern Satrapy. Her totem is unknown.<br /> Silent Pearl, an ancient nautilus-totem who's been in hibernation since the Shogunate. They appear to be non-binary, and I guess they're the No Moon of the pack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 02-13-2019, 08:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T05:55:56-08:00","id":1287502,"title":"","content":"You're right on Silent Pearl, from what's been said elsewhere.<br /> <br /> Tula, based on the KS video, is associated with a bird of some kind (I'm guessing she's the blonde woman in winter gear at a minute in). Tegama's pic doesn't offer any obvious clues to his totem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:03:33-08:00","id":1287503,"title":"","content":"You've got the Castes correct.<br /> <br /> Tegama's spirit shape, since it doesn't come up in the fiction, is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pseudocreobotra_ocellata\" target=\"_blank\">spiny flower mantis</a>. You'll see Tula's soon-ish.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Spiny flower mantis, not an orchid mantis. The perils of pre-coffee posting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":527,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","user":"Robert Vance","date":". 02-13-2019, 09:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:10:59-08:00","id":1287507,"title":"","content":"But... does he practice Mantis style?<br /> <br /> So, we've got one insect, one mammal, and one weird sea creature.<br /> <br /> I'm going to guess Tula's is a bird with green wings, as she has green wings at one point in the fluff (that doesn't prove she does, it might just be a different form, but that's my guess).<br /> <br /> Marin, where is the picture of Tegama?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:13:37-08:00","id":1287508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1287496-chapter-fiction-the-lunar-signature-pack?p=1287503#post1287503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You've got the Castes correct.<br /> <br /> Tegama's spirit shape, since it doesn't come up in the fiction, is an <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hymenopus_coronatus\" target=\"_blank\">orchid mantis</a>. You'll see Tula's soon-ish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Edit: Whoops my mistake!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Gong-Studios-Lunars.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 02-13-2019, 09:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:15:25-08:00","id":1287509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1287496-chapter-fiction-the-lunar-signature-pack?p=1287508#post1287508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is Tegama the person here with the obviously bloody knife while someone else gets to be the patsy?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Gong-Studios-Lunars.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>No, that's not him\u2014he's a man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:16:45-08:00","id":1287510,"title":"","content":"If it's a signature character, I'd guess that's Sazay. It's in the South, and looks to be demonstrating some kind of social charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:21:30-08:00","id":1287512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1287496-chapter-fiction-the-lunar-signature-pack?p=1287507#post1287507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Marin, where is the picture of Tegama?</div> </div> </div> </div>KS video, at around 1:20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:32:56-08:00","id":1287515,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing, from the similar art style, that Sazay is the girl with long brown hair crouching, Tegama is the cocky-looking guy in purple (as Marin said), Tula is the blonde northern girl in green with a spear and a shield showing a bird with green wings, and of course Silent Pearl is the Nautilus-hybrid who I imagine you've all noticed.<br /> And I think these (Mel Uran?) pictures are going to go in the Caste section, one for each, as they're the same style.<br /> <br /> I wonder if the sigs will have two pictures of each for the Caste section; one in human form and one in either animal or hybrid form? That'd be cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T06:59:57-08:00","id":1287521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1287496-chapter-fiction-the-lunar-signature-pack?p=1287515#post1287515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm guessing, from the similar art style, that Sazay is the girl with long brown hair crouching, Tegama is the cocky-looking guy in purple (as Marin said), Tula is the blonde northern girl in green with a spear and a shield showing a bird with green wings, and of course Silent Pearl is the Nautilus-hybrid who I imagine you've all noticed.<br /> And I think these (Mel Uran?) pictures are going to go in the Caste section, one for each, as they're the same style.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bingo! <span style=\"color:white\">10char</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T08:43:10-08:00","id":1287546,"title":"","content":"Cool!<br /> <br /> So, I have to say, I really like these signature characters, from what we've seen so far.<br /> <br /> I wasn't particularly excited by the Solar sigs or the Dragonblood sigs. I know others liked them, but to me they were pretty meh.<br /> <br /> But I like these.<br /> 1) There's a mix of classic totems (fox-girl trickster) and stranger ones that will inspire players' own creativity (nautilus, mantis).<br /> 2) The Casteless character isn't Casteless because she hates Castes (which 2nd ed seemed to believe was the reason you'd be Casteless), she's Casteless because she's only just met other Lunars, and there's no time to travel far away to get tattooed; her people are suffering right now. That, I think, is the main reason why you actually get Casteless.<br /> My friend plays a Casteless who hates the Silver Pact; but both of my Casteless have simply been so because they were new Lunars, and there was no time to wander off and join the pact because plot was happening.<br /> 3) Holden was keen on a &quot;barbarian aesthetic&quot; which was somewhat contraversial. I was happy with it though; to me, it conjures up Germanic or Celtic tribes clashing with Rome, or Xiongnu/Mongols/Manchus clashing with China. And obviously the Realm is Rome-China. Anyway, while they have avoided much use of the word in the text, Tula looks, to me, like a fierce barbarian warrior of the North, like a Goth or Viking or something. I don't need the word if I've got the art. Now, yes, I can understand that people want city-dwelling Lunar sophisticates as well, but most Lunars don't come from cities or &quot;civilised lands&quot; (partly because most people in Creation don't) and I want the art to evoke that.<br /> 4)The No Moon isn't cis, from what I can tell. No Moons are supposed to be shamans, and there are a number of societies where shamans were associated with non-cis identities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 02-13-2019, 12:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T23:22:51-08:00","id":1287869,"title":"","content":"Anyone else have an opinion?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T06:31:36-08:00","id":1287918,"title":"","content":"I think the important, true, enduring elements of the \u201cbarbarian\u201d aesthetic are coming through in the Silver Pact even with the rejection of \u201cbarbarism\u201d as a concept outside of dehumanizing political labeling.<br /> <br /> The bartering system of trading favors, for example. Which is what the Scarlet Dynasty does all the time, of course. The difference being that the Dynasty has a shared monetary system to supplement bartering.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T07:40:49-08:00","id":1287936,"title":"","content":"I like them a lot, definitely my favourite sigs of this edition. They\u2019re all interesting and likeable, with good motivations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}